1
00:00:11,110 --> 00:00:12,120
We’re still in Ireland.

2
00:00:13,060 --> 00:00:15,302
We arrived in Dublin four days ago.

3
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:20,643
My sister and I liked it a lot – it was great – we weren’t bored at all!

4
00:00:21,380 --> 00:00:33,660
Then yesterday, after lunch, Dad hired a car and we travelled to the west of Ireland – it didn’t take very long, just about two and a half hours, but that was a bit boring.

5
00:00:34,580 --> 00:00:40,205
But, after two hours, Dad turned round to us and said: ‘We’ve got a surprise for you.

6
00:00:40,640 --> 00:00:44,440
Tonight our hotel is a castle! How exciting is that!’

7
00:00:45,360 --> 00:00:47,320
A joke, right? Wrong!

8
00:00:47,960 --> 00:00:50,220
We didn’t think he was serious, but he was!

9
00:00:50,220 --> 00:00:55,180
At the end of the journey, we stopped outside a real castle.

10
00:00:56,160 --> 00:00:59,600
A nice lady welcomed us and started to show us around.

11
00:01:00,300 --> 00:01:01,540
What an amazing place!

12
00:01:02,580 --> 00:01:06,804
Can you believe that we walked up fifty stone steps to get to the living room?

13
00:01:07,660 --> 00:01:12,806
The castle is over 600 years old, but it had everything we needed.

14
00:01:13,360 --> 00:01:17,322
There was a bedroom for our parents and we each had a bedroom, too.

15
00:01:17,780 --> 00:01:23,020
But I didn’t sleep very well last night – I was so excited to be in a real castle!

16
00:01:24,280 --> 00:01:28,540
This morning we had breakfast and then we climbed up to the top of the castle.

17
00:01:29,280 --> 00:01:32,624
We were amazed at the beautiful countryside around us.

18
00:01:33,420 --> 00:01:37,980
Then it started to rain and there was a fantastic rainbow – I love rainbows!

19
00:01:38,880 --> 00:01:41,889
The place was so great, we didn’t want to leave.

20
00:01:42,740 --> 00:01:47,195
This afternoon we want to go to Limerick, so we’re packing our bags again!

21
00:01:47,760 --> 00:01:50,900
Can it be as good as a castle? Let’s see.
